Abstract = {In general, mental fatigue refers to the phenomenon of declining ability
   of human perception, memory, attention and other cognitive caused by
   insufficient sleep, biological rhythm disorders or long time focusing.
   The main research work of this paper is as follows: Make a research on
   the reasonable way to induce mental fatigue. The volunteers in fatigue
   group continuously operate 140 min number ``2-back{''} task, while the
   volunteers in normal group only operate ``2-back{''} task at the first
   and last 10 min. Subjects' task performance and ERP component are
   compared between the first 10 min and the last 10 min. The dynamic
   change of task performance and ERP component was studied. The results
   confirmed that 140 min ``2-back{''} task successfully induces mental
   fatigue.},
