   It identifies and manages items through intelligent perception,
   recognition technology and ubiquitous network. In this paper, we put
   forward adopting Mobile IPv6 (MIPv6) in Internet of Things. Firstly, we
   make a brief introduction of the Internet of Things and Mobile IPv6, and
   then we analyze the address characteristics and security of Mobile IPv6.
