   achievement. It visualizes the phenomenon obtained by the results of
   laboratory research. This research was to design and develop the marker
   of radioactive concepts. The stages consist of determine the
   instructional needs and goals, develop the markers, and quality review.
   We generate two markers for this concept: radioactive light penetration
   and radioactive light beam by electric field. The markers were developed
