Abstract = {Hospital Italiano de Buenos Aires (HIBA) is an academic tertiary care
   hospital highly specialized that has started the process of
   informatization of chemotherapy protocols. The objective is to describe
   the development of a computerized physician order entry (CPOE) oriented
   to the oncology adult patient and the members of the healthcare team
   that works with him (physicians, pharmacists, nurses and administrative
   staf) to improve the process and prevent errors at a critical point in
   the patients health care: during prescription, preparation and / or
   administration. The development of this system consisted of several
   stages: inquiries about the usual work and perception of needs of the
   potential users; user-centered design; interoperability with the
   electronic health record (EHR) and development of a fmal prototype},
