   Istanbul Kultur Univ, Istanbul, TURKEY, MAY 24-26, 2013},
Abstract = {The theme focuses on quality assurance and on the efficiency of the
   continuing training programmes in University of Resita. Our experience
   and pressures have determined to underline: the way that the teachers of
   the undergraduate level perceive the continuing training programmes, the
   identification of professional development needs and the perception of
   the career development from the school's management point of view. Our
   research is based on this three coordinates and it analyses on two
   perspectives: from the trainer's perspective and from the institution's
   one. Our main research method is qualitative (over 900 interviews and
   associative verbal tests). The results are presented in this paper along
   with our observations and recommendations. (C) 2013 The Authors.
