Organization = {German Acad Exchange Serv Fdn; IMRE Alumni Network},
Abstract = {A new challenge on recent hotel human resource management in China is
   how to manage the 1980s' staff, which refers to staff born in 1980s,
   wisely due to their unique characteristics. In this paper, the authors
   conducted a semi-structured interview with four hotel managers to gain a
   general evaluation of 1980s hotel employees and their characteristics
   and performances in hotels. In order to understand the 1980s hotel
   employees' perception towards hotel work, the authors applied an
   Exploratory Factor Analysis. The results revealed that there were three
   main items that should be concentrated including participating in
   decision making process, reasonableness in employees' payments and more
   promotion opportunities. The research was concluded by management
   strategies and implications based on data analyses and discussion.},
