   Bucharest, ROMANIA, OCT 27-30, 2011},
Organization = {Romanian Soc Appl Expt Psychol},
Abstract = {The purpose of the study is to analyze the level of the psychological
   and pedagogical competences of the teachers-didacticians in universities
   for the configuration of continuous training programs based on their
   real training needs. The used instrument Questionnaire analyzing the
   perceptions of the teachers in the university and pre-university
   environment regarding the holding of psychological and pedagogical
   competences allowed the collection of data revealing a high deficit of
   psycho-pedagogical training of the targeted group and - related to this
   - the necessity to focus continuous training programs on the development
   especially of psychological competences. The made diagnostic study thus
   acquires the value of a needs analysis. (C) 2012 Published by Elsevier
