   Indonesia; Intel Educ; Asus; Acer},
Abstract = {The purpose of this study was to analyze the effect of corporate image
   toward relationship of quality and effect on moderating variables,
   namely the use of information technology by students in improving the
   influence of private universities image toward relational quality. The
   research method used is descriptive and explanatory survey. The unit of
   analysis consists of 474 students. Data collection is using
   questionnaires and process of data with Warp PLS 3. The results showed
   significant and positive structural effects, as well as the parameters
   that form the endogenous and exogenous variables. Private universities
   in Jakarta should consider the use of information technology as a means
   of learning, so that students' perceptions about the image of the
   college more influence on commitment, trust and satisfaction of
   students.},
