   policy supported by social perception, an incorporate with the
   environment impact assessments, cost-benefit analysis and intellectual
   property. Ecotechnology of phytoremediation is cost effective and
   ecologically friendly in which plant utilizes its natural abilities to
   restore environment. It is the use of green plant based systems to
   remediate contaminated soils, sediments, water or air. Some epiphyte
   plants, especially those from Spanish moss, Tillandsia useneoides
   (Bromeliaceae), known as air plants, has been widely used in
   biomonitoring studies of air pollution in South America countries. The
   aim of this paper was to review the biological living of T. useneoides
